  "project_description": "This simple module lets you see each module's filesystem path (location) on the module list page at /admin/modules. It is useful for developers maintaining legacy projects with modules in unexpected locations, and for multisite installations, distributions/profiles, and similar setups where a module can live in several places. It has no configuration and adds no routes, permissions, or services of its own; it simply alters the core modules-list form and its theme output to append a Location line to each module's details.",
